基于762万实体维基百科知识图谱自动生成问题的搜索智能体基准，旨在解决BrowseComp等现有基准趋于饱和的问题。在11个前沿模型测试中，最佳得分仅34.74%，远低于当前模型在BrowseComp上约90%的成绩；上下文策略仅带来+6.8个百分点的提升。该基准包含544道问题、11个领域，采用树与图结构，已开源。","reportEdition":"2026-07-18","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrpinmua028mbisr48qfxlrz","title":"Apple 研究：Show Me Examples — 从图像集推断视觉概念","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-07-18T20:18:27.709Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmrpinmua028mbisr48qfxlrz","https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/visual-concept-inference"],"articles":[{"id":"cmrpinmua028mbisr48qfxlrz","title":"Apple 研究：Show Me Examples — 从图像集推断视觉概念","originalTitle":"","summary":"Apple 机器学习研究团队提出一种方法，让视觉语言模型（VLM）仅从图像集示例中推断视觉概念，无需文本指令。该方法通过对比示例图像与候选图像，使模型捕捉颜色、纹理等视觉规律，在多个概念推理基准上提升准确率。该研究目前为学术论文，未公布模型或 API 可用性。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrpinmua028mbisr48qfxlrz","originalUrl":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/visual-concept-inference","publishedAt":"2026-07-18T20:18:27.709Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-nkf46e","originalSourceName":"Apple Machine Learning Research（RSS）","family":"outlet-xqluk8","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrpinmua028mbisr48qfxlrz","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-12T14:49:43.047Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-nkf46e","name":"Apple Machine Learning Research（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-12T14:49:43.047Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"Apple 机器学习研究团队提出一种方法，让视觉语言模型（VLM）仅